rea (LIB 287)","title":"Second-Floor Study Area","subtitle":"LIB 287, J. Paul Leonard Library","notes":"Use this second-floor open study area when you want to work near the Team Collaboration Spaces and the Library’s group-study and media-viewing area.","short_summary":"An open second-floor study area near team-work rooms.","evidence_claim":"The Library's second-floor map lists Study Area (LIB 287), Team Collaboration Space 1 and 2, and Group Study and Media Viewing.","source_url":"https://library.sfsu.edu/floor-maps","source_title":"Floor Maps | J. Paul Leonard Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on the Library's second floor. The Library describes its first through third floors as collaborative spaces; Library use requires an SFSU OneCard or SFSU ID.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sfsu-library-study-area-lib-360","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Study Area (LIB 360)","title":"Third-Floor Study Area","subtitle":"LIB 360, J. Paul Leonard Library","notes":"Work among children’s books, government reference books, maps and atlases, microfiche, and microfilm when those collections support your assignment.","short_summary":"A third-floor study area alongside reference collections and maps.","evidence_claim":"The Library's third-floor map lists Study Area (LIB 360) with children's books, government reference books, maps and atlases, microfiche, and microfilm.","source_url":"https://library.sfsu.edu/floor-maps","source_title":"Floor Maps | J. Paul Leonard Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on the Library's third floor, which the Library describes as a collaborative space. Library use requires an SFSU OneCard or SFSU ID.","cost_status":"unknown","under21